The vector field X y i = u(y) ρ(y) (grad_g v y) i = u(y) ρ(y) ∑ j invMatrix i j ∂ⱼv(y) has compact support (u has compact support). Then weighted_divergence_integral_eq_zero ρ X gives ∫ ∑ᵢ ∂ᵢ(ρ Xᵢ) = 0, i.e. ∫ ∑ᵢ ∂ᵢ(u ρ (grad_g v)ᵢ) dx = 0.

